From f16c32a8c5a1b3b53deb03f71a174a168beaa956 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FunnyAWM <1142978300@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:21:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): headless artifact variant drives the machine's
 runtime

HERMES_DESKTOP_VARIANT=headless ships no agent runtime and never boots
one: it resolves the explicit override, the checkout recorded at build
time (localRuntimeRoot), then the installed-runtime rungs, and fails
with actionable guidance when nothing is usable. Identity, stamp and
version reporting are separate from the bundled and light artifacts, so
both installs can coexist. The rungs live in headless-runtime.ts and
source-backend.ts to keep main.ts and resolveHermesBackend within their
code-health ratchets.
